  Key insight: Don't fight Polar Express — piggyback on it.
  The 3-step variant should be ~60% of Polar Express cost
  while providing SELECTIVE SV boosting (Muon boosts everything to 1).
  Gradient direction info is PRESERVED (Muon discards magnitudes).

  For training: β is your exploration knob.
    β=0.0 → vanilla gradient
    β=0.1 → mild exploration of neglected directions
    β=0.3 → moderate (recommended starting point)
    β=0.5 → aggressive exploration
    β=1.0 → equivalent to Muon (all SVs → σ_max)
